{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261124/photo/bkn-20261124232147870-1124_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261124232147\"/><p>兩名泰國籍女子被捕。</p><p>油尖區警員今日（24日）在區內展開掃黃行動，突擊搜查尖沙咀加拿分道一住宅單位。行動中，人員以涉嫌「違反逗留條件」拘捕兩名分別27歲及30歲的泰國籍女子。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:03:52.895388+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:21:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:57:15.943984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:57:15.943984+00:00","content_hash":"6db7c6e11f65a3a41921d75fa63b96f4c6244ff62d14a6d9542a07108d29577a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}